<p class="callout callout-note">Resize your browser to mobile width (or use devtools), then click the hamburger menu in the top right. That drawer is powered by this controller.</p>

<h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>

<pre><code class="language-html">&lt;body data-controller="mobile-nav"&gt;
  &lt;!-- Toggle Button --&gt;
  &lt;button data-mobile-nav-target="toggle"
          data-action="click->mobile-nav#open"
          aria-expanded="false"&gt;
    Menu
  &lt;/button&gt;

  &lt;!-- Backdrop --&gt;
  &lt;div data-mobile-nav-target="backdrop"
       data-action="click->mobile-nav#closeOnBackdrop"
       class="mobile-nav-backdrop"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;!-- Drawer --&gt;
  &lt;nav data-mobile-nav-target="drawer"
       class="mobile-nav-drawer"&gt;
    &lt;button data-action="click->mobile-nav#close"&gt;Close&lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;!-- Navigation links --&gt;
  &lt;/nav&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;</code></pre>

<h2 id="targets">Targets</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Target</th>
      <th>Purpose</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
