<h2 id="css">Required CSS</h2>

<pre><code class="language-css">.mobile-nav-backdrop {
  @apply fixed inset-0 bg-gray-900/50 z-40;
  @apply opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity;
}

.mobile-nav-backdrop.open {
  @apply opacity-100 pointer-events-auto;
}

.mobile-nav-drawer {
  @apply fixed top-0 right-0 h-full w-80 bg-white z-50 shadow-xl;
  @apply transform translate-x-full transition-transform;
}

.mobile-nav-drawer.open {
  @apply translate-x-0;
}</code></pre>

<h2 id="features">Features</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Escape key closes drawer</li>
  <li>Backdrop click closes drawer</li>
  <li>Body scroll is locked when open</li>
  <li>ARIA attributes update automatically</li>
</ul>
